      "ArticleTitle": "Intesive fludarabine-high dose cytarabine-idarubicin combination as induction therapy with risk-adapted consolidation may improve treatment efficacy in younger Acute Myeloid Leukemia (AML) patients: Rationales, evidences and future perspectives.",
